<br>
Na Aoun Aur Na Qasim Na Bhayya Akbar Hai<br>
Na Baba-Jaan Na Ammu Na Nanha Asghar Hai<br>
Bala Ke Ban Me Musibat Ne Hamko Ghera Hai<br>
<br>
Sunaoun Kya Tumhe Hampar Guzar Gayi Ammu<br>
Phuphi Tho Ab Ghadi Jiteji Margayi Ammu<br>
Suna Jo Qafela Kufe Me Aake Thaira Hai<br>
<br>
